Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of this project are derived from Zed (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed),
Copyright (C) Zed Industries, Inc., licensed GPL-3.0-or-later. This is why
mjx-acp-viewer is itself GPL-3.0-or-later.

Derived from Zed:

  crates/mjx-acp-thread/
      Port of zed `crates/acp_thread/` (acp_thread.rs, mention.rs, terminal.rs)
      with the GPUI, MultiBuffer and Project dependencies removed.

  crates/mjx-acp-thread/src/paths.rs
      The parts of zed `crates/util/src/paths.rs` that mention.rs needs
      (PathStyle, is_absolute, PathWithPosition), written from the call sites:
      zed's util crate is not in reference/, only the ACP crates are.

  crates/mjx-agent-catalog/
      Port of zed `crates/project/src/agent_registry_store.rs` and
      `crates/project/src/agent_server_store.rs` (registry fetch, npx/binary
      distribution resolution, npm version bounding).

  crates/mjx-acp-core/  (MethodCorrelator)
      Port of the request-id to method-name correlation in zed
      `crates/acp_tools/src/acp_tools.rs`.

  web/src/  (UI structure)
      The component breakdown follows zed `crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/
      thread_view.rs` and `crates/acp_tools/src/acp_tools.rs`.

  reference/zed-acp/
      Unmodified copies of the above Zed crates, kept for reference. Local-only
      and git-ignored: not compiled, not shipped, not in this history. See
      reference/README.md.

